{"change_summary":"No additional code changes were required in this Apply Fixes pass. The latest review approved the root-zone oxygenation implementation and the final follow-up amendments, including the defensive effective-penetration clamp and the cached-vs-fresh habitat-registry documentation, with no blocking fixes requested.","outstanding_risks":["This stage relies on the latest approved validation results rather than rerunning a fresh test pass.","Validation in the latest implementation/review pass was scoped to the `tank_core` package; broader workspace packages such as `tank_harness` were not rerun in this stage.","Two non-blocking cleanup opportunities remain from review: `Engine::from_parts` still discards the returned `SubstrateOxygenationBreakdown` during initialization, and the public `root_oxygenation_active_biomass_g()` / `substrate_oxygenation_breakdown()` accessors still recompute the habitat registry for standalone callers."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the latest approved review results to confirm whether any blocking amendments were requested for the implemented root-zone oxygenation fixes.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply additional code changes for review follow-up items.","order":2,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Record the approved validation state from the latest package test, clippy, formatting, and targeted regression runs.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["Latest review outcome was `approved` with no blocking amendments required.","`cargo fmt --all --check` was clean in the latest review validation.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib systems::substrate::tests -- --nocapture` passed (24/24).","`cargo test -p tank_core --test root_zone_oxygenation -- --nocapture` passed (5/5).","`cargo test -p tank_core` passed across the full `tank_core` package test suite.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings` passed.","Review confirmed the final amendments were present: the defensive `effective_penetration_cm` clamp and the explicit `substrate_oxygenation_breakdown()` documentation for fresh-registry standalone callers versus the cached-registry hot path."]}